## Proposed Changes

### Backend Route Modifications
- Remove the old UI (`app/index.html` and backups).
- Remove the redirect endpoints (`@app.get("/")` and `/dashboard`) in `app/main.py`.
- Add a new fallback route at the bottom of `app/main.py` that mounts the compiled Next.js `out/` folder using FastAPI's `StaticFiles(html=True)`.

